# directory-rules.md — Rule Template Definition

## Optional Rules

- [required] Directory purpose: use & boundary
- [required] Directory structure: tree
- [required] Naming rules: English names; single responsibility
- [optional] Git treatment: commit / exclude / user decides
- [optional] Changelog: date / change
- [optional] Reference rules: relative paths

## Rule Content

- Directory rule items (per optional rules list)
- Each item: condition → behavior (short item)

## Rule Expression

- Short itemized sentences
- No rule numbering
- No decision info or references
